                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.0.0-beta.4 (2026-05-28)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Migrated to the TypeSpec-based provisioning generator using the &lt;code&gt;2025-12-01-preview&lt;/code&gt; API version.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
